SUMMARY:2774 - Garden Focaccia and Tiramisu
DESCRIPTION:Come over for a  for a cozy and flavorful hands-on class featuring two Italian favorites: focaccia and tiramisu with Chef Sophia Dickmyer. You will learn how to make a beautiful\, deeply flavorful focaccia dough\, discover the best toppings\, and personalize your own flatbread. Then\, finish on a sweet note by preparing a classic tiramisu from scratch. Perfect for bakers and home cooks looking to expand their Italian repertoire! \nHands on. BYOB. Ages 16 and up. Vegetarian \n\nFocaccia Start to Finish\nPersonalized Toppings\nTraditional Tiramisu
URL:https://zestchef.com/class/2774-garden-focaccia-and-tiramisu/
