SUMMARY:2778 - Knife Skills 101
DESCRIPTION:This class teaches you the single\, most important skill you need to master for meal prepping success! Chef Cat Alwine will teach you proper knife cuts\, tips for safety and efficiency\, as well knife care. Take home recipes to use up all your prepped ingredients that you chop. Plus get a 15% discount towards any chef’s knife at the Zest store!  Hands-On. Ages 16 and up. Gluten Free. Vegetarian \nTake Home Recipes Include: \n\nHomemade Vegetable Stock\nStrawberry Pico de Gallo\nSummer Vegetable Minestrone
